	(descr "D67 / D99 / D107 test point as a microvia-capped land: SMD land D0.30 on F.Cu + F.Mask with the test-point property, no paste (probe target, flat cap), single terminal. The through-via pad (D0.35 / drill 0.20) of TestPoint_Via_D0.35mm_Drill0.2mm is dropped: the net reaches the land through one HDI laser microvia (0.10 hole, 0.25 land, copper filled, in pad) placed by the router inside the land (0.025 margin). D109 least density: body = land, courtyard 0.50 x 0.50 (was 0.56 x 0.56); excluded from BOM and position files as before. Derived from lib:TestPoint_Via_D0.35mm_Drill0.2mm (same frame, pad numbers, 3D model, F.Fab body, no component silk); spec hardware/tools/land_specs/TestPoint_Pad_D0.30mm_MicroVia_L.json")
